      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 38 Slane Road, Crumlin, Dublin 12 to the market a superb two-bedroom mid terraced home presented in immaculate turnkey condition throughout. Situated on this mature and highly sought-after residential road, No. 38 enjoys an exceptionally convenient location with an abundance of local amenities on its doorstep including Sundrive Shopping Centre, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and a variety of local shops. The area is well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools, excellent sporting and recreational facilities and numerous Dublin Bus routes, while the M50, N7 and Dublin City Centre are all easily accessible, making this an ideal location for first time buyers.\n\nBright and beautifully presented internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, sitting room, modern fully fitted kitchen with dining area, two generous bedrooms and a stylish family bathroom. A standout feature of the property is the cleverly converted attic, creating a superb additional room that is currently utilised as a dedicated home office. Perfectly separated from the main living accommodation, it offers an ideal space for those working from home, studying or simply seeking a peaceful retreat.\n\nNo. 38 has been lovingly maintained and upgraded by its current owner, leaving nothing for the successful purchaser to do except unpack. Recent improvements include painting, new flooring throughout, a new gas fired boiler, and a beautifully maintained interior. Externally, the property benefits from off street parking to the front, a low maintenance rear garden and a block-built shed providing excellent additional storage.\n\nOffering stylish turnkey accommodation, a versatile home office space and an enviable location close to every conceivable amenity, No. 38 is the perfect opportunity for first time buyers looking to step onto the property ladder. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today  on 0861304080 or 012241630 to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 64 sqm\n• BER E2\n• 2 Bed / 1 Bath\n• Mid terraced home\n• Turn key condition\n• Off street parking\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Low maintenance rear garden\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for first time buyers\n• Viewing highly advised\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D12 Y8CK"
      },
      {
